{
  "startedAt": "2026-10-11T14:23:00.340Z",
  "steps": [
    "Actual twelve-module, twenty-eight-capability editor mounts independent properties authoring with stable UUID targets. Real WebGL2 pixels and software/hardware renderer identity are recorded. Fields start unselected and unchanged decoded Name review cannot authorize Apply. Name is a textarea without a UTF-16 maxlength.",
    "With Name explicitly selected but its textarea display untouched, native review preserves original decoded CRLF and CR characters while changing only Color. Complete before/after object and BOM/CRLF source keep UUIDs, transforms, camera, light and other objects. Chinese, English and Japanese at 390 px retain selections, raw values and approval with one responsive column, reachable footer and no horizontal overflow. Cancel writes neither draft nor disk.",
    "Apply accepts the exact current-token receipt and changes only the unsaved source memory. Fresh readonly preview shows changed shaded pixels for the authored color. Ordinary Save writes the exact reviewed BOM/CRLF candidate, and reopen retains the original CRLF/CR decoded Name and mixed-case Color.",
    "Native property review accepts literal LF, blank-space and control-character names, and exactly 256 astral Unicode codepoints without trimming or a UTF-16 limit. It rejects 257 codepoints, empty Name and invalid Color, retaining the local raw input and leaving source untouched. These name-boundary candidates are cancelled.",
    "A selected second stable UUID receives only explicit raw Name and Color fields, preserving whitespace, LF, Unicode, literal HTML text and hex case. All other objects and transforms remain unchanged. Save/reopen keeps the exact declaration, and author text does not become HTML in target options.",
    "A silent legal target change before Check cannot review the old closure: the displayed target is restored and approval denied. After review, silent checkbox, Name, Color and UUID mutations revoke approval. A newer real source edit also revokes ownership and cannot be overwritten by a previous candidate.",
    "A legitimate property draft still uses ordinary Save preconditions. A real external disk change triggers the existing conflict dialog; Cancel retains external bytes and the unsaved property draft independently. No implicit Save occurs in properties authoring.",
    "With WebGL2 explicitly injected unavailable, readonly preview truthfully reports no draw while actual native property review remains enabled. The independent form has no renderer, World, execution or Save dependency."
  ],
